  "description": "Overview Bhaktiwala is a devotional app for Indian families: live darshan, pandit booking, katha streaming, kundli, daily rituals, and AI-enabled consultation with Pandit G, all in one place. We're opening a live marketing brief to all college students. Over 20 days, you'll take a real product at launch stage and drive installs. What You Have to Do Drive a minimum of 10 verified installs through your referral code. You can also submit (optional) a roadmap to generate more users for Bhaktiwala. An install counts only when someone downloads the app through your code and runs the kundli feature at least once. A download alone doesn't count. Getting your code: register, download the app, sign up, and your unique referral code appears in the 'more' section. Guidelines Drive installs through any legitimate means - tapping into your network, creating content etc. An install counts only if they are active, that is, they log in and use a feature You can view people who have registered through the app in the 'More' section. The highest number of downloads would be ranked as 1st, 2nd and 3rd for the cash prizes worth 6k!",
