    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Bhaktiwala is a devotional app for Indian families: live darshan, pandit booking, katha streaming, kundli, daily rituals, and AI-enabled consultation with Pandit G, all in one place.</p>\n<p>We're opening a live marketing brief to all college students. Over 20 days, you'll take a real product at launch stage and drive installs.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>What You Have to Do</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Drive a minimum of 10 verified installs through your referral code.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>You can also submit (optional) a roadmap to generate more users for Bhaktiwala.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>An install counts only when someone downloads the app through your code and runs the kundli feature at least once. A download alone doesn't count.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Getting your code: register, download the app, sign up, and your unique referral code appears in the 'more' section.</p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Drive installs through any legitimate means - tapping into your network, creating content etc.</li>\n<li>An install counts only if they are active, that is, they log in and use a feature&nbsp;</li>\n<li>You can view people who have registered through the app in the 'More' section.</li>\n<li>The highest number of downloads would be ranked as 1st, 2nd and 3rd for the cash prizes worth 6k!&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>",
